---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Stergerea datelor — Tapselo POS"
  description="Cum ceri stergerea datelor tale din Tapselo POS, inclusiv a mesajelor trimise prin Facebook Messenger catre pagina unui magazin."
>
  <Navbar />

  <header class="bg-primary pt-28 pb-16 md:pt-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl italic text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Stergerea datelor
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-on-primary/80">
        Cere stergerea datelor tale din Tapselo. Un email este suficient.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-text-on-primary/50">
        Ultima actualizare: 17 august 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="bg-surface-white py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-12 px-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Ai scris unui magazin pe Messenger</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Daca ai trimis mesaje pe Facebook Messenger catre pagina unui magazin care foloseste
          Tapselo, ai doua metode ca sa ceri stergerea:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 pl-5 text-text-secondary">
          <li class="list-disc leading-relaxed">
            Trimite un email la
            <a href="mailto:contact@tapselo.com" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">contact@tapselo.com</a>
            si scrie numele paginii de Facebook careia i-ai scris.
          </li>
          <li class="list-disc leading-relaxed">
            Sau trimite cuvantul <strong class="font-bold text-primary">STERGERE</strong> pe
            Messenger, catre aceeasi pagina.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Stergem mesajele tale si propunerile de comanda derivate din ele in cel mult 30 de zile
          si iti trimitem o confirmare. Nu ai nevoie de cont Tapselo ca sa faci cererea.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Ai un magazin cu cont Tapselo</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Daca vrei sa stergi contul si toate datele magazinului, scrie-ne la
          <a href="mailto:contact@tapselo.com" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">contact@tapselo.com</a>
          de pe adresa de email a contului. Stergem utilizatorii, produsele, preturile, vanzarile,
          documentele de receptie si mesajele primite prin Messenger in cel mult 30 de zile, apoi
          confirmam pe email.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Daca vrei doar sa opresti colectarea mesajelor, deconecteaza pagina de Facebook din
          panoul de administrare. Colectarea se opreste imediat, iar contul ramane activ.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Ce pastram dupa stergere</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Pastram doar documentele pe care legea romana ne obliga sa le pastram, de exemplu
          evidentele fiscale ale vanzarilor. Acestea nu contin mesaje Messenger si nu contin
          identificatorul tau de expeditor.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Referinta pentru aplicatia Facebook</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Aceasta pagina este URL-ul oficial cu instructiuni de stergere a datelor
          (Data Deletion Instructions URL) pentru aplicatia Facebook Tapselo. Detaliile complete
          despre prelucrare sunt in
          <a href="/privacy" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">Politica de confidentialitate</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">English summary</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          This page is the Data Deletion Instructions URL for the Tapselo Facebook app.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          <strong class="font-bold text-primary">Messenger customers:</strong> to have your data
          deleted, email
          <a href="mailto:contact@tapselo.com" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">contact@tapselo.com</a>
          with the name of the Facebook Page you messaged, or send the word "STERGERE" to that Page
          on Messenger. We delete your messages and any order suggestions derived from them within
          30 days and confirm when it is done. No Tapselo account is needed.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          <strong class="font-bold text-primary">Store owners:</strong> email us from your account
          address to delete your account and all store data (users, products, prices, sales,
          receiving documents and Messenger messages). Deletion happens within 30 days and we
          confirm by email. To stop collection only, disconnect the Facebook Page in the admin
          panel; collection stops immediately.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          We retain only records Romanian law requires us to keep, such as fiscal sales records.
          Those contain no Messenger content and no sender identifiers. See the
          <a href="/privacy" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">privacy policy</a>
          for full details.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
